  "description": "Ju-Eun escaped from Korea to London―to find herself entrapped in the blue eyes of a particular singer. In her third year of being in London, she met and fell for Eden―a tall, blond, tattooed, gorgeous, and gifted musician in a punk band―a dangerously alluring man accepting of all and wanted by all. And with that, Ju-Eun's once-plain life in London takes a drastic turn. She is willing to love just Eden, but will Eden come to love only Ju-Eun?\n\n**Original Webtoon :**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=849898), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14051143)\n\n**Official Translations:**     \n[French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/romance/pale-blue-eyes/list?title_no=10637), [Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/romance/pale-blue-eyes/list?title_no=10734)",
